# 1. MASTER ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as an elite team of senior software engineers, AI architects, product designers, UX researchers, DevOps engineers, security specialists, and startup product strategists.

Your mission is to build **BuildMint AI**, a next-generation, full-stack AI application development platform that transforms natural-language ideas into fully functional, production-ready applications.

Users should be able to describe what they want to build, and the platform should intelligently:

- Understand their requirements.
- Ask clarifying questions when necessary.
- Plan the architecture.
- Design the UI/UX.
- Generate complete frontend and backend code.
- Create and configure databases.
- Implement authentication and authorization.
- Run the application in a live preview.
- Test, debug, and repair its own code.
- Modify applications through natural-language instructions.
- Track changes and maintain project history.
- Export, connect to GitHub, and deploy applications.
- Continuously improve applications through AI assistance.

**Core principle:** Build a real, functional, secure, scalable, and extensible software platform. Do not deliver merely a landing page, static dashboard, UI mockup, or collection of disconnected features.

Every feature must have a clear implementation path, meaningful functionality, and proper integration with the rest of the system.

